      "published_at": "2026-11-06T15:00:02Z",
      "title": "I was high on DePaul coming in, and last night made me even more of a believer. Roster has size (Gwath, Flores), ball handling (Meeusen, Blocker), shooting (Popoola, Gwath, Meeusen), and supplemental scoring (McClure, Cotton, Holmes). Could be their first 20+ win team since 2007.",
