        "text": "DePaul! Hangs on for a huge non-con win over USF, 82-80. DePaul’s offense looked as good as I’ve ever seen it in the first half before going ice cold down the stretch. Layden Blocker hits a late pull-up middy to cement the win. Nice résumé booster in November.",
